OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear and
OL,6,Fdry to start the night. Soon clouding
OL,7,Fover, with rain moving in from the
OL,8,Fwest affecting most places by Monday
OL,9,Fmorning. The wind eases to a light
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA grey and wet start to the
OL,13,Fday, with rain clearing northeastwards
OL,14,Fduring the afternoon. Drier conditions
OL,15,Ffollow, but skies remain cloudy for
OL,16,Fmost. Turning breezy, especially along
OL,17,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
