OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fwith rain and showers Tuesday morning,
OL,7,Fclearing later. Dry on Wednesday, with
OL,8,Fthe wind easing during the afternoon.
OL,9,FFoggy Thursday morning, with sunny
OL,10,Fspells later, and a light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
